#: ../../source/docs/common-mounting-the-flight-controller.rst:5
#: f9f745dc2a874789bec2bce61d23ac1a
msgid "Mounting the Autopilot"
msgstr "安装飞控"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mounting-the-flight-controller.rst:7
#: 5bc147624a7042bf885ad858efd46aa6
msgid ""
"This article explains how to mount the autopilot in standard and alternative"
" orientations."
msgstr "本文介绍如何以标准方向和其他方向安装飞控。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mounting-the-flight-controller.rst:11
#: 11db504f8f43497cbb7f536eba15651f
msgid "Standard orientation"
msgstr "标准安装方向"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mounting-the-flight-controller.rst:13
#: b88dbf53985d49d9bde6cb7d24568159
msgid ""
"The :ref:`autopilot <common-autopilots>` (Pixhawk etc.) should be housed "
"within a case (which includes foam over the barometer) and should be mounted"
" with the white arrow pointing directly towards the front of the vehicle."
msgstr ""
":ref:`飞控 <common-autopilots>` （Pixhawk "
"等）应放置在外壳内（外壳包含气压计上方的泡沫），并以白色箭头直接朝向飞行器前方的方式安装。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mounting-the-flight-controller.rst:18
#: 1b026ad47d504fccbe35358ecfe98628
msgid ""
"It should be placed close to the center of gravity of the vehicle (both "
"horizontally and vertically).  Generally this means it should be placed "
"within a few centimeters of the middle of the vehicle and level with the "
"motors.  It is not critical that it is placed exactly at the middle but "
"closer is better (there are no recorded cases of problems caused by the "
"controller being far from the centre of gravity).  If the autopilot cannot "
"be placed at the center of the vehicle setting the :ref:`IMU position offset"
" parameters <common-sensor-offset-compensation>` may improve performance "
"slightly."
msgstr ""
"飞控应放置在飞行器重心附近（水平和垂直方向均是）。通常应放置在飞行器中部几厘米范围内，并与电机保持水平。放置位置不必严格居中，但越近越好（没有已知的因飞控远离重心而导致问题的案例）。如果飞控无法放置在飞行器中心，设置"
" :ref:`IMU 位置偏移参数 <common-sensor-offset-compensation>` 可能会略微提升性能。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mounting-the-flight-controller.rst:27
#: b26bae9d775a4a44a43e7744f515e13a
msgid ""
"The board should be attached to the frame using 4 cubes of vibration "
"dampening foam approximately 3/4 inch square (3M foam can be purchased from "
"`mRobotics <https://store.mrobotics.io/product-p/mro-pxfoams-mr.htm>`__)."
msgstr ""
"控制板应使用 4 块约 3/4 英寸见方的减震泡沫块固定到机架上（3M 泡沫可从 `mRobotics "
"<https://store.mrobotics.io/product-p/mro-pxfoams-mr.htm>`__ 购买）。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mounting-the-flight-controller.rst:36
#: e05227a234654600955a8522835dac10
msgid ""
"Vibration dampening foam is a simple and effective mechanism for vibration "
"control. If :ref:`Measuring Vibration <common-measuring-vibration>` shows "
"that it is not sufficient, alternative mechanisms are discussed in "
":ref:`Vibration Damping <common-vibration-damping>`."
msgstr ""
"减震泡沫是一种简单有效的震动控制方式。如果 :ref:`测量震动 <common-measuring-vibration>` 表明其不够充分，可参考 "
":ref:`震动隔离 <common-vibration-damping>` 了解其他方案。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mounting-the-flight-controller.rst:41
#: bf171508bf02404db15b43ff60445ece
msgid "Alternative orientations"
msgstr "其他安装方向"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mounting-the-flight-controller.rst:43
#: 0a8fd97b7e8741a58d29ddb1ea7edda8
msgid ""
"If the standard orientation of the Autopilot is not convenient, it can be "
"mounted in over 30 other possible orientations.  The full list of possible "
"orientations can be seen and set through the Mission Planner **Config/Tuning"
" \\| Advanced Params** screen, look for the ``Board Orientation "
"(AHRS_ORIENTATION)`` parameter."
msgstr ""
"如果飞控的标准安装方向不方便，可以以 30 多种其他可能的方向安装。所有可能的方向可以通过 Mission Planner 的 "
"**Config/Tuning \\| Advanced Params** 界面查看和设置，查找 ``Board Orientation "
"(AHRS_ORIENTATION)`` 参数。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mounting-the-flight-controller.rst:49
#: 177c8579090d4ca3979fa47567afd07e
msgid ""
"For Roll values, positive means roll right (i.e. \"Roll90\" means board is "
"rolled right 90 degrees so the white arrow still points forward but the "
"board is standing on its right edge)."
msgstr "对于横滚值，正值表示向右横滚（例如「Roll90」表示控制板向右横滚 90 度，白色箭头仍朝前，但控制板竖立在其右侧边缘上）。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mounting-the-flight-controller.rst:53
#: dd9b6f9964e44de9b363a58f3d5a1396
msgid ""
"For Pitch values, positive numbers indicate pitch back (i.e. \"Pitch90\" "
"means the board's nose is pitched up 90 degrees so the arrow points directly"
" up)"
msgstr "对于俯仰值，正值表示向后仰（例如「Pitch90」表示控制板前端向上仰起 90 度，箭头直接朝上）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mounting-the-flight-controller.rst:57
#: 66d06f9abebe4378bcc883ed7611132a
msgid ""
"For Yaw values, positive numbers indicate the nose of the board is rotated "
"clockwise (i.e. \"Yaw90\" means board is rotated so white arrow points off "
"to the right)."
msgstr "对于偏航值，正值表示控制板鼻部顺时针旋转（例如「Yaw90」表示控制板旋转后白色箭头指向右方）。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mounting-the-flight-controller.rst:64
#: b7368d6a2b0d442f878668eff828bc6c
msgid ""
"If the board is mounted in a non-standard orientation (i.e. arrow is not "
"pointing forward) then please ensure the "
":ref:`AHRS_ORIENTATION<AHRS_ORIENTATION>`  is properly set before doing the "
"accelerometer calibration."
msgstr ""
"若飞控以非标准方向安装（即箭头不朝前），请在进行加速度计校准之前确保 :ref:`AHRS_ORIENTATION<AHRS_ORIENTATION>`"
" 已正确设置。"
